e last week while fuel inventories fell following a drop in refining activity in the Midwest, the Energy Information Administration said on Wednesday."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Oil product inventories in Asia's fuel trading hub of Singapore fell to a three-week low, government data showed on Thursday, with stocks retreating across the barrel week-on-week."]},{"type":"p","children":["NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- U.S. Energy Secretary Chris Wright on Wednesday said a U.S. ban on diesel exports would not work and could push up gasoline and jet fuel prices, a stance at odds with President Donald Trump, who is backing the idea."]},{"type":"p","children":["- A White House official on Wednesday denied a news report that said the US is preparing a 90-day ban of diesel exports in an attempt to control record prices for fuel widely used by farms, trains and trucks."]},{"type":"p","children":["- U.S. ultra-low-sulfur diesel futures HOc1 fell 4% on Wednesday after Politico reported that the White House is preparing a plan to ban diesel exports for 90 days, which the Trump administration denied."]},{"type":"p","children":["- China will raise retail gasoline and diesel prices following gains in global oil prices but cap the increases to cushion the impact on the domestic market, the National Development and Reform Commission said on Thursday."]},{"type":"p","children":["PRICES"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["MIDDLE DISTILLATES"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CASH ($/BBL)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ASIA CLOSE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["